let __v_293 = Value::from("Milk is the whole diet before six months, so there is no set amount: eight to twelve feeds in 24 hours, on demand, day and night. Six or more wet nappies a day and a baby who settles after a feed mean they are getting enough, and the scales settle it better than the ounces. Nothing else goes in the bottle - no cereal, no water unless it is hot.");
